# Agents Harness

Before starting implementation:

```bash
bash scripts/harness/agent-preflight.sh
```

Before marking work complete:

```bash
make check
# or: bash scripts/harness/check.sh
```

Both must exit 0. If a new check is added (lint, test, skill lint), wire it into `scripts/harness/check.sh`.

Reading order: `AGENTS.md` → relevant `docs/` → matching `skills/*/SKILL.md` → path-scoped rules.

Do not skip harness because the change "is docs only" — skill frontmatter lint still applies.
